00:25:47,457 --> 00:25:48,778
[SPEAKER_02]: Not seeing it as an absent owner.

409
00:25:49,458 --> 00:25:54,701
[SPEAKER_02]: Well, you get to then appropriate everything that you assume that that self owns.

