00:26:44,436 --> 00:26:46,196
[SPEAKER_02]: That's what image is.

422
00:26:46,617 --> 00:26:58,200
[SPEAKER_02]: Within that, you can discern now the direction, the content of the sense objects, or the absence of sense objects, you can discern the content, like, of further images in your mind, as in

