431
00:27:26,927 --> 00:27:29,228
[SPEAKER_01]: In some way, there was an image there.

432
00:27:29,348 --> 00:27:29,528
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

433
00:27:30,049 --> 00:27:30,349
[SPEAKER_02]: Exactly.

434
00:27:30,389 --> 00:27:31,189
[SPEAKER_02]: It would not have been known.

435
00:27:31,289 --> 00:27:31,469
[SPEAKER_02]: Yeah.

436
00:27:31,609 --> 00:27:32,830
[SPEAKER_01]: Resistance is already an image.

437
00:27:33,090 --> 00:27:33,750
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, exactly.

438
00:27:33,770 --> 00:27:36,711
[SPEAKER_02]: You can only... You cannot think of resistance and then the image resists.

